# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

# Mintlify parses and serves every Markdown file under this directory that is
# not listed here, whether or not docs.json puts it in the navigation. These
# are internal to the repository and must not become public pages.

# Generator sources, not site pages. Without this Mintlify tries to parse the
# Markdown under scripts/ as MDX and chokes on its SPDX comment header.
scripts/

# How to work on this site: the layout, the generators and their contracts.
# Written for contributors and for Claude, not for readers of the docs.
README.md
AGENTS.md

# The deploy runbook: an open plan-tier decision and a known-breakage list,
# neither of which belongs on a public page. Only this file -- the rest of
# mintlify/ is the stylesheet, brand assets, fonts and images the site serves,
# and ignoring the directory would unpublish all of them.
mintlify/DEPLOYMENT.md

# Written into the page tree (docs/<product>/<version>/) by
# mintlify/scripts/version-manager.js at the first real freeze: a marker file
# and the freeze metadata, not content.
.version-frozen
.version-metadata.json
